  "bodyHash": "d6d37231c52b7dff",
  "content": "\n\nPlease provide the text you would like translated into Russian.\n\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/bundle.png\" alt=\"一个 Serilum 整合包。用心制作。将 Serilum 的模组打包在一起，方便下载！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-bundle.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"关于本整合包\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>Extra Bundle（额外内容整合包）</strong> 是一种特殊的模组类型，它将 Serilum 的多个<strong>extra-type（额外内容型）</strong>模组合并为一个。虽然将我的模组打包在一起对我来说很困难，但我尝试这样做是为了让大家安装起来更方便。它使用了一种名为 JiJ（Jar in Jar，即“Jar 包内嵌 Jar”）的系统。这意味着包含的模组在内部保持完全独立，但允许你像安装整合包一样方便地安装它们。所有模组仍然保留各自的配置文件，并且你会在游戏内的模组列表中找到它们。<br><br>该整合包是整合包开发的辅助工具，但并不能替代我个人偏好的模块化模组系统。不过，你可以通过整合包的配置文件禁用其中包含的模组。<strong>更改配置后需要重启游戏才能生效。</strong><br><br>由于 JiJ 系统的工作方式，它既兼容单独正常安装该模组，也兼容与整合包内置的模组共存。这主要用于强制使用特定版本，同时如果不小心通过这种方式重复安装了模组也不会造成冲突。虽然可能不会引发问题，但最好还是只安装一次。因此，如果你决定安装此整合包，可以移除其他属于该整合包的模组。<br><br>希望这个整合包对喜欢大型内容模组的你有所帮助。非常感谢大家多年来的支持！<br><br></span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/both.svg&w=586\" alt=\"运行环境：客户端与服务器\" width=\"293\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可配置项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的配置选项：</p><details><summary>显示详情</summary><span><strong>enableAllLootDrops</strong>&nbsp;(default = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableAprilFools</strong>&nbsp;(default = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableBiggerSpongeAbsorptionRadius</strong>&nbsp;(default = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableBouncierBeds</strong>&nbsp;(default = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableCryingGhasts</strong>&nbsp;(default = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableCryingPortals</strong>&nbsp;(default = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableDeathBackup</strong>&nbsp;(default = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableEasyElevators</strong>&nbsp;(default = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableEdibles</strong>&nbsp;(default = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableExtractPoison</strong>&nbsp;(default = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableFallThroughSlime</strong>&nbsp;(default = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableFasterCrouching</strong>&nbsp;(default = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableFixedAnvilRepairCost</strong>&nbsp;(default = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableGrassSeeds</strong>&nbsp;(default = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableHandOverYourItems</strong>&nbsp;(default = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableInfiniteTrading</strong>&nbsp;(default = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableMilkAllTheMobs</strong>&nbsp;(default = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableNameTagTweaks</strong>&nbsp;(default = true)</span><br><span><strong>enablePaperBooks</strong>&nbsp;(default = true)</span><br><span><strong>enablePassiveEndermen</strong>&nbsp;(default = true)</span><br><span><strong>enablePlaceableBlazeRods</strong>&nbsp;(default = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableRandomBoneMealFlowers</strong>&nbsp;(default = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableRandomSheepColours</strong>&nbsp;(default = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableRandomShulkerColours</strong>&nbsp;(default = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableShulkerDropsTwo</strong>&nbsp;(default = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableTNTBreaksBedrock</strong>&nbsp;(default = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableTranscendingTrident</strong>&nbsp;(default = true)</span><br><span><strong>enableVillagerDeathMessages</strong>&nbsp;(default = true)</span></details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/available-bundles.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可用整合包\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;以下 Serilum 模组整合包可供下载：</p><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-client-bundle.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-client-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum 客户端整合包</a></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-customization-bundle.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-customization-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum 自定义整合包</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-extra-bundle.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum 额外内容整合包</a></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-qol-bundle.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum 体验优化整合包</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-rpg-bundle.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum RPG 整合包</a></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-spawn-bundle.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-spawn-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum 出生点整合包</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/mods-included.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"包含的模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/all-loot-drops.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/all-loot-drops\" target=\"_blank\">全部战利品掉落</a></td>\n<td>生物会以可配置的数量掉落所有可能的战利品，支持掠夺附魔。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/april-fools.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/april-fools\" target=\"_blank\">愚人节</a></td>\n<td>在愚人节当天启用各种有趣且可配置的搞怪功能！</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/bigger-sponge-absorption-radius.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/bigger-sponge-absorption-radius\" target=\"_blank\">更大的海绵吸水半径</a></td>\n<td>每相邻放置的海绵方块都会增加吸水的半径。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/bouncier-beds.gif\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/bouncier-beds\" target=\"_blank\">更弹的床</a></td>\n<td>玩家在床上会以可配置的高度弹起，并防止在床上摔落受伤。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/crying-ghasts.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/crying-ghasts\" target=\"_blank\">哭泣的恶魂</a></td>\n<td>当玩家靠近时，恶魂会定期掉落眼泪，实现可持续种植。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/crying-portals.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/crying-portals\" target=\"_blank\">哭泣传送门</a></td>\n<td>允许使用哭泣的黑曜石方块创建下界传送门。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/death-backup.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/death-backup\" target=\"_blank\">死亡备份</a></td>\n<td>在玩家死亡前创建背包备份，可通过指令加载。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/easy-elevators.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/easy-elevators\" target=\"_blank\">简易电梯</a></td>\n<td>通过多方块电梯轻松快速上下楼！高度可配置，利用现有资源即可建造。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/edibles.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/edibles\" target=\"_blank\">可食用材料</a></td>\n<td>使大量材料变为可食用，食用后玩家将获得短暂的增益效果。允许食用烈焰粉、萤石粉、岩浆膏、糖、恶魂之泪、幻翼膜和兔子脚。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/extract-poison.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/extract-poison\" target=\"_blank\">提取毒素</a></td>\n<td>使用空玻璃瓶从洞穴蜘蛛、河豚和蜜蜂身上提取毒素。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/fall-through-slime.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fall-through-slime\" target=\"_blank\">穿透粘液块</a></td>\n<td>粘液块在静止时不再支撑你的体重，你会缓慢穿过它。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/faster-crouching.gif\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/faster-crouching\" target=\"_blank\">更快的潜行移动</a></td>\n<td>潜行时也能以正常速度奔跑和行走。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/fixed-anvil-repair-cost.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fixed-anvil-repair-cost\" target=\"_blank\">修复铁砧维修费用</a></td>\n<td>修改铁砧默认设置等级费用、材料费用和修复百分比。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/grass-seeds.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/grass-seeds\" target=\"_blank\">草籽</a></td>\n<td>允许玩家使用普通种子将泥土转化为（高）草丛。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/hand-over-your-items.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/hand-over-your-items\" target=\"_blank\">物品交接</a></td>\n<td>增加玩家之间直接传递物品堆的功能，无需丢弃或投掷。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/infinite-trading.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/infinite-trading\" target=\"_blank\">无限交易</a></td>\n<td>防止村民交易锁定，使其始终保持可用。尽情交易吧！</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/milk-all-the-mobs.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/milk-all-the-mobs\" target=\"_blank\">万物皆可挤奶</a></td>\n<td>允许绵羊、羊驼、猪、驴、马和骡子产出桶装牛奶。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/name-tag-tweaks.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/name-tag-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\">名牌微调</a></td>\n<td>添加名牌的合成配方与指令，命名后的实体死亡时会掉落名牌。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/paper-books.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/paper-books\" target=\"_blank\">纸质书籍</a></td>\n<td>允许使用 9 张纸合成书籍。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/passive-endermen.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/passive-endermen\" target=\"_blank\">被动末影人</a></td>\n<td>防止末影人在被注视时传送、放置/拾取方块（破坏）和攻击。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/placeable-blaze-rods.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/placeable-blaze-rods\" target=\"_blank\">可放置的烈焰棒</a></td>\n<td>使烈焰棒可以作为自定义方块放置在世界中，类似末地烛。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/random-bone-meal-flowers.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/random-bone-meal-flowers\" target=\"_blank\">随机骨粉花朵</a></td>\n<td>随机化骨粉生成的花朵种类，允许所有（包括模组）花朵在任何地方生长。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/random-sheep-colours.gif\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/random-sheep-colours\" target=\"_blank\">随机绵羊颜色</a></td>\n<td>根据可配置列表为新刷新的绵羊赋予随机的羊毛/皮毛颜色。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/random-shulker-colours.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/random-shulker-colours\" target=\"_blank\">随机潜影贝颜色</a></td>\n<td>根据可配置列表为新刷新的潜影贝赋予随机的外壳颜色。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/shulker-drops-two.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/shulker-drops-two\" target=\"_blank\">双份潜影壳</a></td>\n<td>允许潜影贝掉落两个或更多外壳，并忽略其默认掉落几率。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/tnt-breaks-bedrock.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/tnt-breaks-bedrock\" target=\"_blank\">TNT 炸毁基岩</a></td>\n<td>允许 TNT 炸毁基岩，轻松前往下界顶端！</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/transcending-trident.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/transcending-trident\" target=\"_blank\">超越三叉戟</a></td>\n<td>改进三叉戟。手持水桶即可在任何地方使用威力更强的激流附魔。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/villager-death-messages.png\"></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/villager-death-messages\" target=\"_blank\">村民死亡提示</a></td>\n<td>每当村民死亡时，广播一条信息性死亡提示。</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"注意事项与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>只要下载源仍托管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态内，你就可以在任何整合包中自由使用此整合包。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模组的概览和更多信息。</span><br><span><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他反馈，请访问&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub 仓库</a>。感谢支持！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/markdown",
  "type": "modrinth"
}
